{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-addo-play-limited-out-to-impress-creative-candles-kit-2602-0293","content_id":"f19f8dbf-c227-45ad-9125-f4f55f00002b","description":"Product Recall for Addo Play Limited Out to Impress Creative Candles Kit presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"42901bff-7a43-42d0-bee0-84ef3d540d36","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-28T12:11:00+01:00","id":"42901bff-7a43-42d0-bee0-84ef3d540d36","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-05-28T12:11:00+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1822c4050971fbebf3bba0/2602-0293_-product-recall-addo-play-limited-creative-candles.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Addo Play Limited Out to Impress Creative Candles Kit</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as the sand included in the set may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by the manufacturer Addo Play Limited, and the following retailers: The Entertainer and Early Learning Centre, Hobbycraft, Matalan, M&amp;S, and Tesco.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Arts/Crafts/Needlework Sand Supplies</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand </td>\n      <td>Addo Play Limited</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Item Code</td>\n      <td>318-19180-B</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Entertainer/Early Learning Centre Product Number</td>\n      <td>570142</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hobbycraft Product Number</td>\n      <td>6859261000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>M&amp;S Specific Product Code</td>\n      <td>T554448</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Sand art kit with multiple colours of play sand and plastic bottles. The product was sold by The Entertainer and Early Learning Centre, Tesco, Matalan, M&amp;S, Hobbycraft, Moonpig, British Garden Centres, and TG Jones between September 2024 and February 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_42901bff-7a43-42d0-bee0-84ef3d540d36\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1822c4050971fbebf3bba0/2602-0293_-product-recall-addo-play-limited-creative-candles.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by the manufacturer Addo Play Limited, and the following retailers: The Entertainer and Early Learning Centre, Hobbycraft, Matalan, M&amp;S, and Tesco.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, please access the specific business websites below:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Addo Play Limited: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.addoplay.com/product-safety-notices/\">https://www.addoplay.com/product-safety-notices/</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Early Learning Centre: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.elc.co.uk/product-safety-notices\">https://www.elc.co.uk/product-safety-notices</a>\n</li>\n  <li>The Entertainer: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.thetoyshop.com/product-recall-notice\">https://www.thetoyshop.com/product-recall-notice</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Hobbycraft: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.hobbycraft.co.uk/product-recall.html#creative-candles\">https://www.hobbycraft.co.uk/product-recall.html#creative-candles</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Matalan:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.matalan.co.uk/customer-services/product-recall-notice.list\">https://www.matalan.co.uk/customer-services/product-recall-notice.list</a>\n</li>\n  <li>M&amp;S: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.marksandspencer.com/help-and-support/products-and-brands-information\">https://www.marksandspencer.com/help-and-support/products-and-brands-information</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Tesco: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tesco.com/zones/product-recall?srsltid=AfmBOorD8wQURdyBEdepTYplZAx8KTAyRCEzsivtqS89t-s98NgaNvR7\">https://www.tesco.com/zones/product-recall</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.</li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.</li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact the retailer or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">OPSS page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2602-0293</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Adding Hobbycraft recall information. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-06T13:03:07Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-03T12:23:29Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-27T10:48:44Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-27","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-27T10:48:45+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-addo-play-limited-out-to-impress-creative-candles-kit-2602-0293","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-addo-play-limited-out-to-impress-creative-candles-kit-2602-0293","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-addo-play-limited-out-to-impress-creative-candles-kit-2602-0293","content_id":"f19f8dbf-c227-45ad-9125-f4f55f00002b","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-06T13:03:07Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","t